    <h1>GAIN Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>GAIN is responsible for processing personal data as described in this privacy policy. Here, we explain what types of personal data we collect, how we process them, and your rights. This privacy policy applies to the GAIN app and related services.</p>

    <h2>Personal Data We Collect and Process</h2>
    <p>We collect and process the following categories of personal data:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Basic Information:</strong> Username</li>
        <li><strong>Contact Information:</strong> Email address</li>
        <li><strong>Account and Profile Information:</strong> Password, fitness level, and workout feedback</li>
        <li><strong>User Activity:</strong> Training session data, exercise history, and feedback</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Personal data is primarily collected directly from you or generated as you use our services.</p>

    <h3>Google Login Integration</h3>
    <p>If you choose to log in to the GAIN app using Google, we collect the following information from your Google account:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Name:</strong> Used to personalize your user experience.</li>
        <li><strong>Email Address:</strong> Used for account creation, authentication, and communication.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>This information is processed in accordance with this privacy policy and is used solely for the purposes of managing your account and providing services. By using Google login, you agree to Google's privacy policy.</p>

    <h2>How We Use Personal Data</h2>
    <h3>Delivering Services</h3>
    <p>We use your personal data to provide the services of GAIN, such as personalized workouts and fitness level. The legal basis for this processing is the fulfillment of our agreement with you.</p>

    <h3>User Account Management</h3>
    <p>Your personal data is used to manage your account and ensure secure access. This includes enabling you to log in, update your profile, and reset your password. The legal basis for this processing is the fulfillment of our agreement with you.</p>

    <h3>Tailored User Experience</h3>
    <p>We use your data to customize your experience within the app, including adjusting workout plans to suit your fitness level. The legal basis for this processing is our legitimate interest in improving our services.</p>

    <h3>Data Analysis and Service Improvement</h3>
    <p>To enhance our app and provide better recommendations, we analyze data such as workout feedback and user engagement. The legal basis for this processing is our legitimate interest in improving our services.</p>

    <h3>Legal Obligations</h3>
    <p>In some cases, we process personal data to comply with legal obligations, such as those related to accounting and record-keeping.</p>

    <h2>Your Rights</h2>
    <p>You have the following rights regarding your personal data:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Access to Data:</strong> You can request a copy of the data we hold about you.</li>
        <li><strong>Correction of Data:</strong> You can request corrections to any inaccurate or incomplete information.</li>
        <li><strong>Deletion of Data:</strong> You have the right to have your data deleted without undue delay. This includes the ability to delete your account and associated data directly within the app.</li>
        <li><strong>Restrict Processing:</strong> You may request that we restrict how we process your data in certain situations.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>To exercise any of these rights, contact us at <a href="mailto:gain.app.contacts@gmail.com">gain.app.contacts@gmail.com</a>.</p>

    <h2>Data Retention and Deletion</h2>
    <p>We retain your personal data only for as long as necessary to fulfill the purposes outlined in this privacy policy. When you delete your account, all associated data will be permanently deleted unless retention is required to comply with legal obligations.</p>

    <h2>Data Security</h2>
    <p>We are committed to protecting your personal data. Security measures include:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>Encryption of sensitive data such as passwords</li>
        <li>Access control to prevent unauthorized access</li>
        <li>Regular security audits to ensure compliance with data protection regulations</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Contact Information</h2>
    <p>If you have any questions or concerns about how your personal data is processed, please contact us:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:gain.app.contacts@gmail.com">gain.app.contacts@gmail.com</a></li>
    </ul>
    <p>You can also file a complaint with the Norwegian Data Protection Authority (Datatilsynet) if you believe we are not complying with data protection laws.</p>

    <h2>Updates to This Privacy Policy</h2>
    <p>We may update this privacy policy from time to time to reflect changes in our practices or legal requirements. You will be notified of significant changes via email or within the app.</p>

    <p>Thank you for trusting GAIN to support your fitness journey. Your privacy is a priority for us.</p>
    <br/><br/>